#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Seos Football Club is a child theme of Seos Football, built for football clubs, academies and fan sites. It adds an animated results ticker, animated club statistics, a league table and fixtures, the latest club news, a membership call to action, a sponsors strip and demo club content for the footer widget areas. Every section is managed from Appearance > Customize > Football Club Options and is visible with sensible defaults right after activation."
msgstr ""

